{"seq":25,"slug":"code-retrieval-indexing","title":"面向 Agent 的代码检索与索引","stage":"DONE","category":"ai-native-engineering","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/ai-native-engineering/code-retrieval-indexing","rating":{"composite":3.86,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 面向 Agent 的代码检索与索引\n\n一个编码 agent 写错代码，十有八九不是因为模型不会写，而是因为它没看到该看的那几行。在一个几十万行的代码库里，真正决定一次修改成败的，是那个被调用了三百次的工具函数、那个藏在另一个目录里的接口约定、那段定义了边界条件的测试。把这些正确的上下文喂进模型的有限窗口，就是「代码检索」这件事的全部意义。这个 hub 讲的不是通用文档检索，而是专门服务于编码 agent 的那一套取数逻辑。\n\n四条主线层层递进。第一条是**基础**：先想清楚为什么需要检索而不是「把整个库塞进上下文」，检索与上下文窗口之间是怎样一种成本与精度的权衡，以及代码这种高度结构化、靠精确符号说话的材料，凭什么不能照搬给散文设计的那套 RAG。这一层定调——2026 年的共识是，纯向量检索在代码上常常败给 grep 加直接读文件的 agentic search，但向量并未出局，而是退守到它擅长的语义模糊查询。\n\n第二条主线是**索引构建**，也就是离线那半场。代码怎么切块才不会把一个函数拦腰斩断，用什么模型把代码块变成向量，切出来的块和向量又该塞进怎样的数据结构里才能被快速命中。第三条主线是**检索**，即在线那半场：语义检索如何用近似最近邻在向量空间里捞回候选，词法检索与混合检索如何把 BM25 这种「认得变量名」的老办法重新请回来，以及重排与过滤如何把一堆粗排候选收敛成模型真正吃得下的那几块。\n\n第四条主线是**工程实践**，把前三条拧成一条能上线的流水线：代码库 RAG 的端到端形态、代码每分钟都在变带来的新鲜度与增量更新难题、以及那些反复坑人的失败模式和怎样用可复现的评估把它们量出来。读完四章，你应该能判断一个具体场景该用 agentic search、纯向量、还是混合方案，并知道怎样把它建起来、喂新、评好。建议顺着章节读，但每篇都尽量自洽，遇到别处主讲的概念会用链接指过去。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/ai-native-engineering/code-retrieval-indexing/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-code-retrieval","title":"为什么需要代码检索","url":"/h/ai-native-engineering/code-retrieval-indexing/foundations/why-code-retrieval"},{"seq":2,"slug":"retrieval-vs-context","title":"检索与上下文窗口","url":"/h/ai-native-engineering/code-retrieval-indexing/foundations/retrieval-vs-context"},{"seq":3,"slug":"code-vs-text-retrieval","title":"代码检索的特殊性","url":"/h/ai-native-engineering/code-retrieval-indexing/foundations/code-vs-text-retrieval"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"indexing","title":"索引构建","docCount":3,"url":"/h/ai-native-engineering/code-retrieval-indexing/indexing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"chunking-strategies","title":"分块策略","url":"/h/ai-native-engineering/code-retrieval-indexing/indexing/chunking-strategies"},{"seq":2,"slug":"code-embeddings","title":"代码嵌入","url":"/h/ai-native-engineering/code-retrieval-indexing/indexing/code-embeddings"},{"seq":3,"slug":"index-structures","title":"索引结构","url":"/h/ai-native-engineering/code-retrieval-indexing/indexing/index-structures"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"retrieval","title":"检索","docCount":3,"url":"/h/ai-native-engineering/code-retrieval-indexing/retrieval","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"semantic-search","title":"语义检索","url":"/h/ai-native-engineering/code-retrieval-indexing/retrieval/semantic-search"},{"seq":2,"slug":"lexical-hybrid","title":"词法与混合检索","url":"/h/ai-native-engineering/code-retrieval-indexing/retrieval/lexical-hybrid"},{"seq":3,"slug":"reranking-filtering","title":"重排与过滤","url":"/h/ai-native-engineering/code-retrieval-indexing/retrieval/reranking-filtering"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/h/ai-native-engineering/code-retrieval-indexing/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rag-over-codebase","title":"代码库 RAG","url":"/h/ai-native-engineering/code-retrieval-indexing/practice/rag-over-codebase"},{"seq":2,"slug":"freshness-incremental","title":"新鲜度与增量更新","url":"/h/ai-native-engineering/code-retrieval-indexing/practice/freshness-incremental"},{"seq":3,"slug":"pitfalls","title":"陷阱与评估","url":"/h/ai-native-engineering/code-retrieval-indexing/practice/pitfalls"}]}]}